WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 25=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(The Power of Movable Type)

00:49.759 --> 00:50.679
Wei the Fool.

00:52.720 --> 00:53.960
Why don't you come in?

00:54.160 --> 00:56.240
My mother said
you don't need to be announced.

00:58.160 --> 00:58.640
Here.

00:59.920 --> 01:00.800
I'm not cold.

01:11.239 --> 01:11.800
Girl,

01:12.519 --> 01:13.359
(By Wei Hao)
this is a memorial to the Emperor.

01:13.560 --> 01:14.079
Keep it safe.

01:15.240 --> 01:16.039
A memorial?

01:16.600 --> 01:18.200
Shouldn't that be given to my father?

01:21.159 --> 01:22.000
Listen closely.

01:23.719 --> 01:25.399
You must hide this memorial well.

01:25.679 --> 01:26.880
No one can know about it.

01:27.600 --> 01:29.000
If I am killed by the great clans,

01:29.000 --> 01:30.320
please give this to your father.

01:30.560 --> 01:31.359
Do you understand?

01:31.560 --> 01:32.439
Fool,

01:32.439 --> 01:33.679
don't scare me like that.

01:35.050 --> 01:37.190
I'm about to go head-to-head
with the great clans, right?

01:37.200 --> 01:39.159
They won't let me off easily.

01:39.280 --> 01:41.039
If I win, everything will be fine.

01:41.370 --> 01:43.280
I'm just afraid
they'll do something desperate,

01:43.439 --> 01:45.280
so I'm giving this memorial to you first.

01:48.359 --> 01:49.200
It's okay.

01:50.040 --> 01:50.760
Those great clans

01:50.760 --> 01:51.879
won't dare touch me.

01:52.150 --> 01:53.519
If something really happens to me,

01:53.560 --> 01:55.359
your father won't
let them get away with it.

01:55.560 --> 01:57.000
I'm just thinking

01:57.310 --> 01:58.640
that we should have a backup plan.

01:58.920 --> 01:59.519
Girl,

01:59.519 --> 02:00.799
remember what I said.

02:00.879 --> 02:02.120
If anything happens to me,

02:02.359 --> 02:03.560
give it to your father.

02:04.120 --> 02:04.879
Until then,

02:05.319 --> 02:07.519
no one can know
that I've left a memorial with you.

02:10.040 --> 02:11.040
I'll remember.

02:13.212 --> 02:14.012
Wei Hao,

02:14.640 --> 02:15.959
if you're in danger,

02:15.959 --> 02:17.000
then forget it.

02:17.560 --> 02:19.319
I won't marry anyone else.

02:19.840 --> 02:21.359
I'll just wait in the Princess Mansion.

02:22.920 --> 02:23.760
At worst,

02:24.239 --> 02:26.400
we'll just be together
for life without a title.

02:27.200 --> 02:28.799
I'm willing to do that for you.

02:33.200 --> 02:34.400
What nonsense is that?

02:34.599 --> 02:36.319
I'm going to marry you properly.

02:36.390 --> 02:38.079
Why would we be together without titles?

02:39.400 --> 02:40.200
Girl,

02:40.610 --> 02:42.159
as long as you're willing to marry me,

02:42.159 --> 02:44.890
even if the whole world is against it,
nothing can stop me from marrying you.

02:45.079 --> 02:46.159
To heck with those great clans.

02:46.159 --> 02:47.350
They're just a bunch of clowns.

02:49.120 --> 02:49.879
Don't worry.

02:50.239 --> 02:51.520
Hide this memorial well.

02:52.039 --> 02:53.380
And tell my mother-in-law as well.

02:54.360 --> 02:56.319
Tell her to wait for my good news.

03:04.919 --> 03:06.479
What does this Wei Hao think he's doing?

03:07.439 --> 03:08.840
Making us wait for him this long?

03:10.919 --> 03:12.400
He should be here soon.

03:12.400 --> 03:13.199
He's coming.

03:14.159 --> 03:16.759
Is Wei the Fool really that difficult?

03:17.960 --> 03:18.599
Father,

03:19.199 --> 03:20.919
you'll understand once you see him.

03:22.199 --> 03:23.360
Ridiculous!

03:25.560 --> 03:26.759
To think that one man

03:27.759 --> 03:29.039
could reduce the lot of you

03:29.400 --> 03:30.840
to such a pathetic state.

03:31.159 --> 03:32.840
Aren't you ashamed of yourselves?

03:38.120 --> 03:38.919
Clan Leader,

03:38.919 --> 03:39.960
Wei Hao is here.

03:40.240 --> 03:41.479
He's here.

03:51.360 --> 03:52.159
You're all here.

03:59.280 --> 04:01.039
How about I treat you to this meal?

04:03.360 --> 04:04.159
Forget it.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.520
It will be my treat.

04:05.879 --> 04:06.840
Later,

04:07.120 --> 04:08.879
make your situation clear.

04:09.400 --> 04:11.599
It's best to call your engagement off.

04:13.680 --> 04:14.319
Fine.

04:14.960 --> 04:17.039
Should we talk first,

04:17.719 --> 04:19.080
or eat first?

04:19.360 --> 04:21.120
I suggest we eat first.

04:21.240 --> 04:23.120
I'm afraid you won't
have an appetite later,

04:23.120 --> 04:24.520
and that would be a waste.

04:24.919 --> 04:25.719
Wei Hao,

04:25.800 --> 04:27.520
stop trying to intimidate us.

04:29.159 --> 04:30.599
If you don't call off the engagement,

04:30.639 --> 04:31.919
you're effectively

04:32.520 --> 04:33.919
throwing your peerage away, right?

04:39.280 --> 04:40.159
Clan Leader Wei,

04:40.439 --> 04:42.879
if Wei Hao refuses to obey
your orders as clan leader,

04:42.879 --> 04:45.960
can't you just expel him from your clan?

04:48.520 --> 04:49.520
Wei Hao,

04:49.680 --> 04:52.360
listen to me and call off this marriage.

04:52.360 --> 04:54.199
I'll find you

04:54.319 --> 04:55.280
a much better match.

04:55.280 --> 04:56.400
How about that?

04:56.400 --> 04:58.080
The other clan leaders here

04:58.080 --> 04:59.959
all have daughters and granddaughters.

05:00.040 --> 05:02.160
You're a Marquis now.

05:02.480 --> 05:04.079
Take your pick.

05:04.319 --> 05:06.879
Why must you cause such a massive scene?

05:17.319 --> 05:18.120
Clan Leader,

05:19.879 --> 05:21.639
I only like Ning'an.

05:23.199 --> 05:24.920
I only like the Eldest Princess.

05:27.439 --> 05:28.240
What can I do?

05:33.680 --> 05:34.480
Did Wei Hao

05:34.759 --> 05:35.839
tell you

05:35.839 --> 05:37.240
what method

05:37.240 --> 05:38.879
he'll use against those clan heads?

05:39.439 --> 05:40.319
(Wei Hao said)

05:40.720 --> 05:42.279
(to keep the memorial secret.)

05:42.800 --> 05:43.600
No.

05:43.879 --> 05:45.319
He just told me not to worry

05:45.519 --> 05:46.720
and to leave it to him.

05:49.399 --> 05:51.519
(Where does he get this confidence?)

05:52.759 --> 05:53.560
Brat,

05:53.560 --> 05:55.240
what's all this nonsense about love?

05:55.240 --> 05:55.959
Come on.

05:56.800 --> 05:57.759
Listen to me.

05:57.759 --> 05:59.199
I wouldn't steer you wrong.

05:59.199 --> 05:59.959
I'm not listening.

06:02.100 --> 06:03.720
It seems that if we don't clear this up,

06:04.360 --> 06:05.879
no one will have the appetite to eat.

06:08.879 --> 06:11.279
Then, let's settle this first.

06:30.475 --> 06:31.662
(The Analects)

06:39.959 --> 06:40.759
What...

06:48.120 --> 06:49.000
What...

06:49.000 --> 06:50.560
What is this?

06:54.920 --> 06:55.639
Wei Hao,

06:55.639 --> 06:56.879
what are you trying to do?

07:02.700 --> 07:07.100
(Learning and practicing it regularly,
isn't that a joy?)

07:13.912 --> 07:15.562
(The Analects)

07:16.920 --> 07:18.240
What is this for?

07:18.240 --> 07:20.262
(Master said: "Learning and practicing
it regularly, isn't that a joy?")

07:20.262 --> 07:22.312
(Having friends come from far away,
isn't that happiness?)

07:30.850 --> 07:34.437
(Is that not...)

07:35.850 --> 07:37.090
(People of this era)

07:37.319 --> 07:39.560
(Gentleman)
(clearly don't understand the principle of a puzzle.)

07:40.120 --> 07:41.439
(Otherwise, woodblock printing)

07:41.680 --> 07:43.600
(would have evolved
into movable type long ago.)

07:49.300 --> 07:52.825
(Having friends come from far away,
isn't that happiness?)

07:53.319 --> 07:54.800
Just playing tricks.

07:58.120 --> 07:59.399
(Since that's the case,)

07:59.839 --> 08:01.040
(I'll give you all)

08:01.040 --> 08:03.879
(the visual shock of movable type.)

08:31.279 --> 08:31.920
(Is this)

08:32.199 --> 08:33.199
(rubbing?)

08:53.937 --> 08:57.225
(A gentleman focuses on the roots.
Once rooted, the Way grows.)

08:58.662 --> 09:02.900
(Are filial piety and fraternal respect
not the roots of benevolence?)

09:09.439 --> 09:10.560
This...

09:17.159 --> 09:18.639
This...

09:18.750 --> 09:22.487
(A gentleman focuses on the roots.
Once rooted, the Way grows.)

09:24.960 --> 09:25.360
This...

09:30.600 --> 09:31.440
Help me check this.

09:32.240 --> 09:33.399
Are there any typos?

09:33.399 --> 09:34.720
Quick, take a look.

09:35.679 --> 09:36.679
This...

09:36.919 --> 09:37.720
Hurry.

09:39.519 --> 09:40.960
(How can he print things)

09:40.960 --> 09:42.120
(using such simple tools?)

09:42.679 --> 09:43.120
This...

09:43.279 --> 09:44.039
(This...)

09:50.800 --> 09:52.919
(Is he assembling the woodblock
for the second page.)

09:52.919 --> 09:53.987
(Happiness)

09:58.937 --> 09:59.862
(A joy?)

09:59.862 --> 10:01.087
(Learning and...)

10:01.087 --> 10:02.500
(A joy?)

10:02.650 --> 10:03.960
(With just these few characters,)

10:03.960 --> 10:06.370
(is he going to assemble
the woodblocks for the entire book?)

10:08.387 --> 10:09.725
(A joy?
Having friends come from far away)

10:13.879 --> 10:14.879
(It's over.)

10:16.825 --> 10:18.437
(Not resenting when others don't
understand you, isn't that a gentleman?)

10:20.559 --> 10:21.000
This...

10:25.440 --> 10:26.240
This...

10:26.399 --> 10:26.840
This...

10:27.399 --> 10:28.399
Help me take a look.

10:29.080 --> 10:30.830
Did I print
the first two pages correctly?

10:31.120 --> 10:32.200
This... Father...

10:32.480 --> 10:33.279
This is...

10:33.799 --> 10:34.200
This...

10:34.320 --> 10:35.759
You keep moving these around...

10:35.759 --> 10:36.360
What to do now?

10:36.360 --> 10:37.600
And you can print a whole book?

10:38.919 --> 10:39.480
Come.

10:40.320 --> 10:41.240
Pick the characters.

10:41.960 --> 10:42.919
I will let you print

10:43.120 --> 10:44.159
the third page.

10:45.080 --> 10:45.600
No, thanks.

10:46.200 --> 10:47.200
Just give it a try.

10:47.200 --> 10:47.960
No...

10:50.840 --> 10:51.960
What I said before

10:53.320 --> 10:56.639
about selling 100,000 books a month
was a modest estimate.

10:59.000 --> 10:59.519
This...

10:59.879 --> 11:00.799
Let me tell you,

11:01.120 --> 11:02.480
at the very least,

11:03.120 --> 11:04.519
one million books a month.

11:05.559 --> 11:06.919
This...

11:07.000 --> 11:09.519
I can print a hundred
different books at the same time.

11:10.600 --> 11:11.480
This...

11:11.559 --> 11:12.639
I guarantee

11:13.559 --> 11:15.000
that from today onward,

11:15.000 --> 11:16.879
all the scholars in the world

11:17.360 --> 11:18.519
will never lack books again.

11:20.919 --> 11:21.879
(This is bad.)

11:25.399 --> 11:26.639
(This is disastrous.)

11:27.200 --> 11:30.120
(This thing could actually
destroy the great clans.)

11:32.080 --> 11:32.759
Clan Leader Cui,

11:33.919 --> 11:34.720
why don't

11:36.879 --> 11:38.000
you come try it?

11:40.799 --> 11:41.440
Come on!

11:48.462 --> 11:49.620
(I never would have thought)

11:49.639 --> 11:51.759
(that Wei the Fool
actually knew how to do this.)

11:53.200 --> 11:54.559
(Now that he has this,)

11:54.720 --> 11:57.159
(the Emperor can destroy
the great clans whenever he wants.)

11:58.840 --> 12:01.159
(We cannot let
the Emperor find out about this.)

12:01.159 --> 12:03.279
(Otherwise, it's the end
for the great clans.)

12:04.200 --> 12:05.159
Wei Hao,

12:07.320 --> 12:08.440
put it away.

12:08.679 --> 12:09.480
Let's

12:09.600 --> 12:10.919
have a proper talk.

12:11.039 --> 12:11.639
Yes.

12:11.919 --> 12:13.639
Let's have a proper talk.

12:15.799 --> 12:16.840
You want to talk?

12:19.519 --> 12:20.320
Fine.

12:21.919 --> 12:22.360
Pack it up.

12:24.279 --> 12:24.840
Go.

12:50.360 --> 12:51.440
On the 22nd,

12:52.000 --> 12:53.559
for my engagement banquet with Ning'an,

12:54.320 --> 12:55.279
be there on time.

12:55.537 --> 12:56.550
(Invitation)

12:57.650 --> 12:59.487
(The 22nd of this month, respectfully
from Wei Hao and Wei Ning'an)

13:13.840 --> 13:15.759
Are you coming or not? Say something!

13:16.519 --> 13:17.399
We'll come.

13:17.399 --> 13:18.200
Don't you worry.

13:18.200 --> 13:18.840
We'll be there.

13:19.039 --> 13:20.159
Yes, we'll come.

13:20.600 --> 13:21.600
We will be there.

13:22.960 --> 13:23.600
Good.

13:24.480 --> 13:25.279
Now, let's talk.

13:26.000 --> 13:27.830
How are you going to
compensate me for this?

13:29.440 --> 13:30.639
If I release this thing,

13:30.879 --> 13:32.679
it'll make at least 30,000 guan a month.

13:33.200 --> 13:34.399
So, what's your final word?

13:34.679 --> 13:35.960
Shall I release it or not?

13:36.759 --> 13:38.720
Of course, you shouldn't release it.

13:38.720 --> 13:39.759
Right...

13:40.200 --> 13:41.039
Clan Leader Wei,

13:41.320 --> 13:42.639
persuade your young kinsman.

13:42.799 --> 13:44.240
Ask him not to be impulsive.

13:44.240 --> 13:45.000
Exactly.

13:45.440 --> 13:46.399
Wei Hao,

13:46.519 --> 13:47.759
don't be impulsive.

13:47.759 --> 13:48.480
You see,

13:48.600 --> 13:51.039
we don't oppose your marriage

13:51.360 --> 13:52.480
to the Eldest Princess.

13:52.879 --> 13:54.799
In fact, we will give you our blessings.

13:57.240 --> 13:58.240
It's just that...

13:58.960 --> 14:00.840
It would be best

14:01.279 --> 14:02.440
to destroy the thing.

14:04.039 --> 14:04.840
Forever.

14:05.000 --> 14:06.800
It's better
if it never appears in the world.

14:07.000 --> 14:08.240
Let's talk first.

14:08.279 --> 14:09.519
If you want to talk,

14:13.519 --> 14:15.240
then show some sincerity.

14:16.799 --> 14:18.679
How about you set your conditions,

14:19.519 --> 14:20.480
and we'll discuss them?

14:20.480 --> 14:21.240
What do you say?

14:21.440 --> 14:21.879
Fine.

14:22.879 --> 14:24.279
In that case, I won't hold back.

14:25.679 --> 14:27.120
I'll give you two choices.

14:27.480 --> 14:28.279
First,

14:29.120 --> 14:31.480
each clan gives me
10,000 guan every year

14:31.480 --> 14:32.679
until the day I die.

14:34.240 --> 14:35.039
Second,

14:35.960 --> 14:38.960
let me recruit 500 students
from humble backgrounds every year.

14:39.159 --> 14:40.360
I will train them.

14:41.399 --> 14:42.879
How...

14:42.879 --> 14:44.279
How can that be acceptable?

14:44.639 --> 14:48.000
You want to train
500 scholars for His Majesty

14:49.080 --> 14:51.360
to be used against us?

14:54.679 --> 14:55.639
Do it now.

15:05.450 --> 15:08.280
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

15:08.900 --> 15:12.300
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

15:13.070 --> 15:16.020
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

15:16.360 --> 15:19.060
♪Sigh and walk away♪

15:20.660 --> 15:24.130
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

15:24.130 --> 15:26.360
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

15:26.360 --> 15:28.470
♪Colors and darkness♪

15:28.470 --> 15:30.490
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

15:30.490 --> 15:34.850
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

15:36.290 --> 15:40.020
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

15:40.290 --> 15:43.890
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

15:44.050 --> 15:46.130
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

15:46.130 --> 15:50.920
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

15:51.140 --> 15:52.760
♪The world mistakes me♪

15:52.760 --> 15:55.100
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

15:55.170 --> 15:56.360
♪As the storm approaches♪

15:56.360 --> 15:58.760
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

15:58.970 --> 16:00.690
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

16:00.690 --> 16:02.670
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

16:02.840 --> 16:04.590
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

16:04.590 --> 16:06.690
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

16:06.690 --> 16:08.160
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

16:08.160 --> 16:10.390
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

16:10.610 --> 16:11.810
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

16:11.810 --> 16:14.330
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

16:14.460 --> 16:16.170
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

16:16.170 --> 16:17.450
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

16:17.600 --> 16:19.020
♪My wish has finally come true♪

16:19.020 --> 16:20.060
♪To stay by your side♪

16:20.060 --> 16:21.980
♪In this fleeting world♪

16:22.150 --> 16:25.400
♪We are free and happy♪

16:29.400 --> 16:31.180
♪From a nobody♪

16:31.180 --> 16:33.080
♪To someone now famous♪

16:33.190 --> 16:34.620
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

16:34.620 --> 16:37.130
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

16:37.230 --> 16:38.810
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

16:38.810 --> 16:40.880
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

16:41.090 --> 16:42.770
♪In this vast world♪

16:42.770 --> 16:44.770
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

16:44.920 --> 16:47.130
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

16:47.130 --> 16:48.720
♪Everything ends eventually♪

16:48.810 --> 16:50.310
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

16:50.310 --> 16:52.710
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

16:52.710 --> 16:54.420
♪No matter how time flies♪

16:54.420 --> 16:55.580
♪Even if the falling snow♪

16:55.580 --> 16:57.210
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

16:57.210 --> 16:58.250
♪All I want now♪

16:58.250 --> 17:00.350
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

17:00.350 --> 17:03.610
♪Year after year♪
